B.DY=new A.bj(B.a5L,["You can reach AGENT support at agentcustomercare@gmail.com or use the Support button on your dashboard.","AGENT Real Estate Platform support email: agentcustomercare@gmail.com.","AGENT operates across Nigeria. Use our platform to explore properties in your preferred state.","All payments on AGENT are processed through Flutterwave and held in Escrow until you take possession of the property.","Our Escrow system ensures the landlord only receives payment once you take possession. This protects both tenant and landlord.","Refund requests are handled through our support team. Please open a support ticket for assistance.","To get verified, go to your Profile and upload your NIN, government ID or utility bill.","KYC (Know Your Customer) verification requires your NIN + government-issued ID. Upload them in the Verification section.","You can browse, filter, and pay for rental properties directly through the AGENT platform.","Landlords can list properties for Sale, Rent, Lease, or Shortlet from their dashboard.","Shortlet properties are available for short-term stays. Browse the shortlet category on your dashboard.","Lease listings offer longer-term arrangements. Check the Lease category in property search.","To cancel a booking or property request, open a support ticket so our team can assist you.","For disputes between tenants and landlords, please open a support ticket and we will mediate.","Property inspections can be scheduled by messaging the landlord via our in-app chat.","Digital tenancy agreements are available on AGENT. Access them from the payment or booking confirmation page.","Your AGENT wallet holds your available balance. Payments are held in escrow and released upon possession.","Hello! I'm AGENT AI Assistant. How can I help you today? Ask me about properties, payments, verification, or open a support ticket.","Hi there! I'm AGENT AI. How can I assist you today?","I can help with: property search, payment questions, verification, support tickets, landlord features, and more. What do you need?"],t.l)
